        "modern_text": "乙亢金龙亢，其度数范围从二度至五度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006408-p000-789f70ea7b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "癸卯金穴分在震宫，逢木金遇木而有用，所以称为才穴；况且这里又是胎孕之宫，因此列于九八中的生气对宫。其对面是癸酉金向，金入金乡，为旺宫之地，所以列于九八中的旺气，故合作上格局。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006410-p000-853bb7e9d0",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "巽卦所属的轸水羽，其度数范围从十三度至十五度；兑卦所属的昴日鸡，其度数范围从胃五度至昴一度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006411-p000-343b31b63d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "辛胃土雉娄，其度数范围从十二度至胃二度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006412-p000-e9d794d4f6",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "兑卦所属的胃土雉，其度数范围从十二度至十四度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006413-p000-eb4b5eb460",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "辛娄金狗，其度数范围从九度至十二度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006414-p000-aeb6f03fbe",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "向卦对应咸卦与归妹卦，穴卦对应损卦与豫卦。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006415-p000-5d509ce645",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "乾卦所属的奎木狼，其度数范围从七度至九度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006416-p000-90a8240452",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "震卦所属的亢金龙角，其度数范围从十度至亢二度；戌娄金狗，其度数范围从一度至九一度。穴卦对应中孚卦与蛊卦。甲辰火水分在辰宫，逢土火见土为泄气，虽有冠带之荣，终是失势，终不在九六之列。其对面是甲戌火向，火入土受泄，又是大墓之乡，俱是死气。况且甲辰为补气之空，故合作下格局。",
